.TH AERO-SYSTEM-MONITOR 1 "November 2026" "Aero Linux v1.4.0" "Aero Linux Manual"
.SH NAME
aero-system-monitor \- Hardware telemetry and developer process inspector
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B aero-system-monitor
[B\-\-guiR] [B\-\-sortR IColumnR] [B\-\-helpR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B aero-system-monitor
visualizes real-time per-core CPU utilization, zRAM compression metrics,
NVMe read/write I/O operations, and container process trees on Aero Linux.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-g ", " \-\-gui
Launch interactive GTK3 graphical monitor.
.TP
.BR \-s ", " \-\-sort " " IColumnR
Sort active processes by: cpu, mem, io, or pid (default: cpu).
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Display brief usage synopsis.
.SH AUTHORS
Written and engineered by Ronit Gupta (@ronitgupta138) for Aero Linux.
